      "amount": "1 packet",
      "notes": "reconstituted in 50 ml water"
    },
    {
      "name": "Scallions",
      "amount": "2 tbsp",
      "notes": "chopped"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sesame seeds",
      "amount": "1 tsp",
      "notes": "toasted"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat sesame oil in a kazan cauldron over medium heat.",
    "Add ginger paste and sauté until fragrant, about 1 minute.",
    "Pour in dashi extract and soy sauce, bring to a gentle simmer.",
    "Stir in shredded Chinese cabbage, cover, and cook until wilted, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add mushroom oyster sauce, wakame seaweed and rice vinegar, stir well.",
    "Reduce heat, simmer uncovered for 3 minutes to blend flavors.",
    "Remove from heat, pour into serving bowls.",
    "Top each bowl with chopped scallions and toasted sesame seeds.",
    "Let the stew rest for 2 minutes before serving.",
    "Serve hot as a light, energizing dinner."
  ],
